 "Чему равен периметр MPRU?": "<figure class='st'><svg viewBox='0 0 377 233' width='100%' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' font-family='ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,sans-serif' role='img' aria-label='Рисунок условия: прямоугольник MPQU'><rect x='30.0' y='26.0' width='316.8' height='172.8' fill='none' stroke='var(--muted,#93a1b1)' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='202.8' y1='26.0' x2='202.8' y2='198.8' stroke='var(--muted,#93a1b1)' stroke-width='1.6'/><line x1='30.0' y1='98.0' x2='202.8' y2='98.0' stroke='var(--muted,#93a1b1)' stroke-width='1.6'/><line x1='130.8' y1='26.0' x2='130.8' y2='98.0' stroke='var(--muted,#93a1b1)' stroke-width='1.6'/><line x1='30.0' y1='62.0' x2='130.8' y2='62.0' stroke='var(--muted,#93a1b1)' stroke-width='1.6'/><line x1='87.6' y1='98.0' x2='87.6' y2='198.8' stroke='var(--muted,#93a1b1)' stroke-width='1.6'/><line x1='145.2' y1='98.0' x2='145.2' y2='198.8' stroke='var(--muted,#93a1b1)' stroke-width='1.6'/><line x1='274.8' y1='26.0' x2='274.8' y2='198.8' stroke='var(--muted,#93a1b1)' stroke-width='1.6'/><line x1='202.8' y1='198.8' x2='274.8' y2='26.0' stroke='var(--muted,#93a1b1)' stroke-width='1.6'/><line x1='274.8' y1='26.0' x2='346.8' y2='198.8' stroke='var(--muted,#93a1b1)' stroke-width='1.6'/><circle cx='30.0' cy='26.0' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><circle cx='130.8' cy='26.0' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><circle cx='202.8' cy='26.0' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><circle cx='274.8' cy='26.0' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><circle cx='346.8' cy='26.0' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><circle cx='30.0' cy='62.0' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><circle cx='130.8' cy='62.0' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><circle cx='30.0' cy='98.0' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><circle cx='130.8' cy='98.0' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><circle cx='202.8' cy='98.0' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><circle cx='87.6' cy='98.0' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><circle cx='145.2' cy='98.0' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><circle cx='30.0' cy='198.8' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><circle cx='87.6' cy='198.8' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><circle cx='145.2' cy='198.8' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><circle cx='202.8' cy='198.8' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><circle cx='274.8' cy='198.8' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><circle cx='346.8' cy='198.8' r='3' fill='#e8eef6'/><text x='20.0' y='20.0' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>U</text><text x='130.8' y='17.0' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>T</text><text x='202.8' y='17.0' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>S</text><text x='274.8' y='17.0' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>R</text><text x='356.8' y='20.0' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>Q</text><text x='19.0' y='103.0' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>V</text><text x='134.8' y='115.0' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>X</text><text x='211.8' y='113.0' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>Z</text><text x='20.0' y='214.8' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>M</text><text x='202.8' y='217.8' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>N</text><text x='356.8' y='214.8' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='13' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>P</text><text x='80.4' y='48.8' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='14' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='500'>A</text><text x='80.4' y='84.8' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='14' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='500'>A</text><text x='166.8' y='66.8' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='14' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='500'>C</text><text x='58.8' y='153.2' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='14' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='500'>B</text><text x='116.4' y='153.2' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='14' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='500'>B</text><text x='174.0' y='153.2' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='14' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='500'>B</text><text x='231.6' y='78.8' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='14' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='500'>D</text><text x='318.0' y='78.8' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='14' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='500'>D</text><text x='250.8' y='165.2' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='14' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='500'>D</text><text x='298.8' y='165.2' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='14' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='500'>D</text></svg><figcaption>Рисунок условия. Слева квадрат MNSU: внизу три B, над ними два A (вместе — TUVX) и квадрат C. Справа четыре равных треугольника D: косые NR и RP и вертикаль из R до низа.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Прямоугольник TUVX сообщает сторону большого квадрата": "<figure class='st fx'><svg class='narrow' viewBox='-40 -26 152 162' role='img' aria-label='Квадрат MNSU: почему t равно v и почему прямоугольник TUVX даёт сторону x'><path fill='none' stroke='#8b98a8' stroke-width='.9' d='M0 0H72V72H0Z'/><path fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='.6' d='M0 30H72M42 0V30M0 15H42M24 30V72M48 30V72'/><text x='-4.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>U</text><text x='42' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>T</text><text x='-4.5' y='31.5' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>V</text><text x='38' y='37.5' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>X</text><text x='-4.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>M</text><text x='77' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>S</text><text x='67' y='37.5' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>Z</text><text x='77' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='4.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>N</text><g class='fi' style='--d:.4s'><rect x='42' y='0' width='30' height='30' fill='#5fd38d' fill-opacity='.16' stroke='#5fd38d' stroke-width='1'/><text x='57' y='18' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='5.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>C</text><g fill='none' stroke='#5fd38d' stroke-width='.6'><path fill='none' d='M42 -10.2V-5.8M42 -8H72M72 -10.2V-5.8'/><path fill='none' d='M77.8 0H82.2M80 0V30M77.8 30H82.2'/></g><text x='57' y='-11' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='4.6' text-anchor='middle'>x − t</text><text x='90' y='17' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='4.6' text-anchor='middle'>x − v</text></g><g class='fi' style='--d:1.4s'><g fill='none' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='.7'><path fill='none' d='M0 -10.2V-5.8M0 -8H42M42 -10.2V-5.8'/><path fill='none' d='M-11.2 30H-6.8M-9 30V72M-11.2 72H-6.8'/></g><text x='21' y='-11' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='5.2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>t</text><text x='-15' y='55' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='5.2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>v</text></g><text class='fi' style='--d:2.2s' x='36' y='100' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='5' text-anchor='middle'>у квадрата C стороны равны:  x − t = x − v,  значит  t = v</text><g class='fi' style='--d:3.0s'><rect x='0' y='0' width='42' height='30' fill='#f0a83c' fill-opacity='.10' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='1.2'/><g fill='none' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='.7'><path fill='none' d='M-11.2 0H-6.8M-9 0V30M-11.2 30H-6.8'/></g><text x='-17' y='17' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='4.6' text-anchor='middle'>x − v</text><text x='21' y='17' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='4.6' text-anchor='middle'>TUVX</text></g><path class='sl' style='--d:3.8s;--to:translate(0px,30px) rotate(90deg)' fill='none' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2.2' stroke-linecap='round' d='M0 0H42'/><g class='fi' style='--d:5.2s'><g fill='none' stroke='#e8eef6' stroke-width='.7'><path fill='none' d='M-26.2 0H-21.8M-24 0V72M-26.2 72H-21.8'/></g><text x='-30' y='38' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='5.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>x</text></g><text class='fi' style='--d:5.6s' x='36' y='116' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='5.4' text-anchor='middle'>t + (x − v)  =  v + (x − v)  =  x</text><text class='fi' style='--d:6.2s' x='36' y='132' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='5.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>P(TUVX) = 144 = 2x   →   x = 72</text></svg><figcaption>Квадрат C стоит между рядом B и блоком A, поэтому его ширина x − t и высота x − v — это одно и то же число, и t = v. А тогда верхняя сторона TUVX (это t) переезжает на левый бок и вместе с боковой стороной x − v достраивает целую сторону квадрата: полупериметр TUVX равен x.</figcaption></figure>",
 "Чтобы его увидеть, обхожу оба контура по сторонам.": "<figure class='st fx'><div class='fgrid2'><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-28 -18 190 108' role='img' aria-label='Контур MNRU'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.9' d='M0 0H132V72H0Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.7'><path d='M72 0V72M0 30H72M42 0V30M0 15H42M24 30V72M48 30V72M102 0V72M72 72L102 0M102 0L132 72'/></g><text x='-4.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>U</text><text x='72' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>S</text><text x='102' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>R</text><text x='136.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>Q</text><text x='-4.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>M</text><text x='72' y='79.5' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>N</text><text x='136.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>P</text><circle cx='72' cy='0' r='2.6' fill='#f2686c'/><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2.2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2.4' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M0 72L72 72L102 0L0 0Z'/><text class='fi' style='--d:0.9s' x='36' y='80' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>x</text><text class='fi' style='--d:1.6s' x='96' y='45' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>d</text><text class='fi' style='--d:2.3s' x='50' y='-6' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>g + x</text><text class='fi' style='--d:2.8s' x='-13' y='40' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>x</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(MNRU) = 324</b> → x + d + (g + x) + x = 324  ⚠ сторона R→U идёт <b>через S</b></p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-28 -18 190 108' role='img' aria-label='Контур NPQR'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.9' d='M0 0H132V72H0Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.7'><path d='M72 0V72M0 30H72M42 0V30M0 15H42M24 30V72M48 30V72M102 0V72M72 72L102 0M102 0L132 72'/></g><text x='-4.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>U</text><text x='72' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>S</text><text x='102' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>R</text><text x='136.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>Q</text><text x='-4.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>M</text><text x='72' y='79.5' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>N</text><text x='136.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>P</text><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2.2s' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='2.4' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M72 72L132 72L132 0L102 0Z'/><text class='fi' style='--d:0.9s' x='102' y='80' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>w − x</text><text class='fi' style='--d:1.6s' x='140' y='40' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>x</text><text class='fi' style='--d:2.2s' x='117' y='-6' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>g</text><text class='fi' style='--d:2.7s' x='95' y='45' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='6.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>d</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(NPQR) = 240</b> → (w − x) + x + g + d = 240</p></div></div><figcaption>Два обхода шага 4. Красная точка в MNRU — та самая S, мимо которой сторона R→U проходит насквозь: g + x, а не x. В обоих обходах косая d и кусок g стоят рядом — общий хвост g + d.</figcaption></figure>",
 "→ P(B) = 132, P(D) = 180": "<figure class='st fx'><div class='fgrid2'><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-28 -18 190 108' role='img' aria-label='Периметр прямоугольника B'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.9' d='M0 0H132V72H0Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.7'><path d='M72 0V72M0 30H72M42 0V30M0 15H42M24 30V72M48 30V72M102 0V72M72 72L102 0M102 0L132 72'/></g><text x='-4.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>U</text><text x='72' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>S</text><text x='102' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>R</text><text x='136.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>Q</text><text x='-4.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>M</text><text x='72' y='79.5' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>N</text><text x='136.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>P</text><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#5fd38d' stroke-width='2.4' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M0 30L24 30L24 72L0 72Z'/><text class='fi' style='--d:0.9s' x='12' y='26' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='6.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>24</text><text class='fi' style='--d:1.5s' x='-13' y='55' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='6.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>42</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(B) = 2·(24 + 42) = 132</b></p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-28 -18 190 108' role='img' aria-label='Периметр треугольника D'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.9' d='M0 0H132V72H0Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.7'><path d='M72 0V72M0 30H72M42 0V30M0 15H42M24 30V72M48 30V72M102 0V72M72 72L102 0M102 0L132 72'/></g><text x='-4.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>U</text><text x='72' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>S</text><text x='102' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>R</text><text x='136.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>Q</text><text x='-4.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>M</text><text x='72' y='79.5' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>N</text><text x='136.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>P</text><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#5fd38d' stroke-width='2.4' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M72 0L72 72L102 0Z'/><text class='fi' style='--d:0.9s' x='66' y='40' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='6.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>72</text><text class='fi' style='--d:1.5s' x='96' y='46' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='6.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>d</text><text class='fi' style='--d:2.1s' x='87' y='-5' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='6.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>g</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(D) = x + (g + d) = 72 + 108 = 180</b></p></div><div class='cell'><svg viewBox='-28 -18 190 108' role='img' aria-label='Периметр MPRU'><path fill='none' stroke='#4a5866' stroke-width='0.9' d='M0 0H132V72H0Z'/><g fill='none' stroke='#3a4757' stroke-width='0.7'><path d='M72 0V72M0 30H72M42 0V30M0 15H42M24 30V72M48 30V72M102 0V72M72 72L102 0M102 0L132 72'/></g><text x='-4.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>U</text><text x='72' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>S</text><text x='102' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>R</text><text x='136.5' y='-3' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>Q</text><text x='-4.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>M</text><text x='72' y='79.5' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>N</text><text x='136.5' y='79' fill='#93a1b1' font-size='6.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>P</text><path class='dr' pathLength='100' style='--d:0.2s;--dur:2s' stroke='#5fd38d' stroke-width='2.4' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' d='M0 72L132 72L102 0L0 0Z'/><text class='fi' style='--d:0.9s' x='66' y='80' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='6.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>132</text><text class='fi' style='--d:1.5s' x='129' y='48' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='6.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>d</text><text class='fi' style='--d:2.1s' x='50' y='-5' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='6.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>g + x</text><text class='fi' style='--d:2.7s' x='-13' y='40' fill='#5fd38d' font-size='6.8' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>72</text></svg><p class='ccap'><b>P(MPRU) = 132 + (g + d) + 72 + 72 = 384</b></p></div></div><figcaption>Три спрошенных обхода. У MPRU верхняя сторона снова идёт от R до U насквозь, через S: g + x, а не x. Куски g и d по отдельности не нужны — в сумму они входят хвостом g + d = 108.</figcaption></figure>"
}